# --- Runtime / deps / build output ---
**/node_modules/**
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/out/**
**/.build/**
**/dist/**
**/.profile-oss
**/coverage/**
**/.vscode-test
**/.playwright-cli
**/.playwright-mcp
**/.chat-simulation-data

# --- Databases locais ---
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
openpolvobackend/build/**

# --- Peso 0: ruído (snapshots, perf, fixtures) ---
**/*.snap
polvocode/test/**
polvocode/src/**/test/**
polvocode/extensions/copilot/test/**
polvocode/extensions/vscode-colorize-tests/**
polvocode/extensions/vscode-colorize-perf-tests/**
**/fixtures/**
**/recordings/**
**/*perf*.data*
**/*perf-data*

# --- Assets binários / packaging ---
polvocode/resources/**
polvocode/build/win32/**
polvocode/build/darwin/**
polvocode/build/linux/**
polvocode/build/azure-pipelines/**
polvocode/build/checksums/**

# --- Tokenizer blobs ---
**/*.tiktoken

# --- Locks e caches de build ---
**/package-lock.json
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache

# --- IDE state (não confundir com .cursorignore) ---
.cursor/projects/**

# --- Tier C: upstream opcional (desabilitado inicialmente) ---
polvocode/src/vs/editor/**
polvocode/src/vs/base/**
polvocode/src/vs/workbench/contrib/notebook/**
polvocode/src/vs/workbench/contrib/debug/**
polvocode/src/vs/workbench/contrib/terminalContrib/**
